  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth in Eastern Equatoria and Juba of South Sudan, will receive TVET and life skills training. ASPIRE will facilitate civil society organizations&apos; participation in TVET programs, conduct market analysis, review curriculum, support trainer professional development, and offer scholarships for youth from other counties to attend TVET centers. Local businesses will be involved to participate in job fairs, support access to decent work, and support small business start-ups.</narrative>
  </description>
